---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Bloom Engine" description="Privacy policy for Bloom Engine.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-desc">How we handle your data on bloomengine.dev.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container legal-content">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Skelpo GmbH ("we", "us", or "our"), the operator of Bloom Engine,
        respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal
        data. This policy explains what data we collect when you visit
        <a href="https://bloomengine.dev">bloomengine.dev</a> and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact information (name, email address, phone number) when you reach out to us.</li>
        <li>Project information you provide to us.</li>
        <li>Technical data (IP address, browser type, device information).</li>
        <li>Usage data (how you use our website).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Providing our services.</li>
        <li>Communicating with you about projects and inquiries.</li>
        <li>Improving our website and services.</li>
        <li>Compliance with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Our website uses cookies to improve user experience. You can disable
        cookies in your browser settings, but this may affect website
        functionality.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Analytics — Plausible</h2>
      <p>
        We use <a href="https://plausible.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plausible Analytics</a>
        to understand how visitors use bloomengine.dev. Plausible is a
        privacy-friendly, cookie-free analytics service hosted in the European
        Union. It does not use cookies, does not collect personal data, and
        does not track visitors across websites or over time. All site
        measurement is carried out anonymously in aggregate, and no personal
        data is stored. You can read more in
        <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plausible's data policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Under the GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your stored data.</li>
        <li>Rectification of incorrect data.</li>
        <li>Deletion of your data.</li>
        <li>Restriction of processing.</li>
        <li>Data portability.</li>
        <li>Object to processing.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to
        protect your personal data from unauthorized access, loss, or
        destruction.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy-related questions or to exercise any of your rights,
        contact us at <a href="mailto:info@skelpo.com">info@skelpo.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    background: var(--bloom-light);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-desc {
    color: rgba(27, 42, 30, 0.6);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal {
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--bloom-dark);
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    color: rgba(27, 42, 30, 0.7);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 1.25rem;
    color: rgba(27, 42, 30, 0.7);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--bloom-green-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
